<<module doc>>=
Survey handling shared by the summary modules.

A survey is an assignment backed by a classic Canvas quiz of survey type
(graded or ungraded survey). Its score says nothing about the student, so
the summary modules count a survey as passed once it is completed and as
failed otherwise.

This is a helper module, not a grading strategy: it has no
summarize_group function and cannot be used with `canvaslms results -S`.
